<title>USA: NYSE closing averages.</title>
<headline>NYSE closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the New York Stock Exchange ended lower in active trading Wednesday.</p>
<p>The Dow Jones Industrial Average fell 139.67 points to 7085.65.</p>
<p>The NYSE Composite fell 5.82 to 424.95.</p>
<p>The average price per share fell $0.58.</p>
<p>Losers beat winners 1657 to 845.</p>
<p>Volume was 497,577,380 compared with 601,295,300 on Tuesday.</p>
